+    /* Stained Glass OS: SG Defender's real-time protection on execute -- an
+     * image (a program being started, a DLL being loaded) is scanned before
+     * anything maps it; one that holds malware is not run, and its section is
+     * not made: ERROR_VIRUS_INFECTED, as Windows Defender's driver fails it.
+     * Not a prefix's fake DLL, nor its copy of one of Wine's own: their code
